message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
- family-names: "Tokdemir"
  given-names: "Doğan Orhun"
  orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-2541-0794"
title: "anonymized-tweet-scraper"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
url: "https://github.com/OrhunTokdemir/anonymized-tweet-scraper"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A terminal application that collects public posts from Twitter/X and
  Ekşi Sözlük, anonymizes them, and writes them to CSV for research. It
  includes a batch mode that builds Turkish offensive-language datasets
  from a seed lexicon, with weakly labeled offensive candidates and
  control posts.
keywords:
  - web scraping
  - twitter
  - ekşi sözlük
  - anonymization
  - turkish
  - offensive language
  - natural language processing
  - dataset
